---
<BaseLayout
  title="Datasheet Automation App"
  description="InBetween Datasheet Automation is a cloud-based solution for fully automated creation of product datasheets in PDF format - directly from your Akeneo PIM."
  lang="en"
>
<div class="datasheet-landing">
<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">Publication Management</div>
        <h1>Automated datasheets<br><span class="highlight">directly from</span><br>Akeneo PIM</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">InBetween Datasheet Automation is a cloud-based solution for fully automated creation of product datasheets in PDF format — directly from your PIM. It enables companies to generate accurate, brand-compliant datasheets instantly, using live product data and predefined templates — without manual design or layout effort.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="https://calendly.com/inbetween-sales/30min" class="btn-primary">Schedule a call</a>
          <a href="#editions" class="btn-secondary">Compare editions</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>2</strong><span>Editions available</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Templates to choose from</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Cloud-hosted</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Example datasheet template previews">
        <img class="hero-template-composite" src="/images/datasheet/ds-0340cb46.png" alt="Three example datasheet templates: laptop, tire and lubrication pump">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SOLUTION OVERVIEW -->
<section id="what-is-it" class="quick-facts-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title quick-facts-title">Solution Overview</h2>
    <div class="quick-facts-rule"></div>

    <div class="quick-facts-grid">
      <div class="quick-facts-copy">
        <div class="quick-fact-block">
          <h3>Who is it for?</h3>
          <p><strong>Manufacturers, distributors, wholesalers, and retailers</strong> managing high-volume or <strong>frequently changing product data</strong>, looking to eliminate manual work across marketing, product management, sales, and external teams.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-fact-block">
          <h3>Purpose:</h3>
          <p>Automated generation of PDF datasheets and product sheets using live <strong>Akeneo PIM product data</strong> — triggered <strong>on demand</strong> or <strong>scheduled for continuous updates</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-facts-list" aria-label="Key capabilities of InBetween Datasheet Automation">
        <ul>
          <li>Fully automated PDF datasheet and product sheet generation from Akeneo PIM data</li>
          <li>On-demand creation or scheduled automation, for example nightly updates</li>
          <li>Dynamic content selection for personalized and use-case-specific datasheets</li>
          <li>Predefined, brand-compliant layout templates structured around your selected product data</li>
          <li>Real-time data synchronization before each generation</li>
          <li>Seamless integration with existing PIM and distribution channels</li>
          <li>Automatic storage and reuse of generated datasheets as linked Akeneo assets</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- EDITIONS -->
<section id="editions">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Choose your edition</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Two editions,<br>one proven workflow</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">As a cost-efficient entry into automated product publishing, it replaces static, one-size-fits-all PDFs with a dynamic, customer-centric experience — delivering tailored, on-demand documents that are always up to date, aligned with specific information needs, and created without complexity.</p>
    <p class="section-lead" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Both editions include a selection of 4 brand-customizable templates and Akeneo integration. During setup, you choose the one template that best fits your datasheet structure. The difference between the editions is <strong style="font-weight:900">how</strong> and <strong style="font-weight:900">when</strong> generation is triggered.</p>

    <div class="edition-grid">

      <!-- Standard -->
      <div class="edition-card">
        <div class="edition-header">
          <span class="edition-badge badge-gray">Entry</span>
          <div class="edition-name">Datasheet Automation</div>
          <div class="edition-desc">On-demand PDF generation triggered manually from within Akeneo. The ideal starting point for automating your datasheet workflow.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-price-block">
          <div class="edition-price">€8,900</div>
          <div class="edition-price-note">per year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-features">
          <ul>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> PDF button in the product header view</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> On-demand single-product generation</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Live data sync from Akeneo before each run</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Choose 1 of 4 predefined layouts</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Customization with your logo and brand colors</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Datasheets auto-saved as linked Akeneo assets</li>
            <li class="dim"><span class="xmk">–</span> Scheduled bulk automation</li>
            <li class="dim"><span class="xmk">–</span> PDF button in product grid view</li>
            <li class="dim"><span class="xmk">–</span> Multi-product delta updates</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-cta">
          <a href="https://calendly.com/inbetween-sales/30min" class="cta-outline">Talk to sales</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pro -->
      <div class="edition-card featured">
        <div class="edition-header">
          <span class="edition-badge badge-red">Professional</span>
          <span class="popular-ribbon">Most popular</span>
          <div class="edition-name">Datasheet Automation Pro</div>
          <div class="edition-desc">Everything in Datasheet Automation, plus fully scheduled bulk automation and grid-view triggering for high-volume workflows.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-price-block">
          <div class="edition-price">€12,900</div>
          <div class="edition-price-note">per year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-features">
          <ul>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Everything in Datasheet Automation</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> <strong>Scheduled bulk automation</strong> — e.g. nightly regeneration for the entire catalog <span class="pro-tag">Pro only</span></li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> <strong>PDF button in product grid view</strong> — trigger delta updates for multiple products at once <span class="pro-tag">Pro only</span></li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> <strong>Multi-product delta updates</strong> in a single action <span class="pro-tag">Pro only</span></li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Choose 1 of 4 predefined layouts</li>
            <li><span class="chk">✓</span> Customization with your logo and brand colors</li>
            
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="edition-cta">
          <a href="https://calendly.com/inbetween-sales/30min" class="cta-filled">Talk to sales</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARISON TABLE -->
<section class="section-sand">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Feature comparison</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">What's included</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">A full side-by-side breakdown so your team can make the right choice from day one.</p>
    <div class="compare-table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:40%">Feature</th>
            <th style="width:30%">Datasheet Automation</th>
            <th class="col-pro" style="width:30%">Datasheet Automation Pro</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>PDF button — product header view</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>On-demand single-product generation</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Live data sync from Akeneo</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Choice of 1 out of choice of 1 out of 4 predefined, brand-customizable layouts</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>CI customization (logo, colors, fonts)</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Datasheets saved as linked Akeneo assets</td><td><span class="tick">✓</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Scheduled bulk automation (e.g. nightly)</td><td><span class="dash">–</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>PDF button — product grid view</td><td><span class="dash">–</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Multi-product delta updates in one click</td><td><span class="dash">–</span></td><td class="col-pro"><span class="tick">✓</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Annual price</td><td>€8,900</td><td class="col-pro">€12,900</td></tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr><td colspan="3">* Annual contract. Contact sales for a binding quote.</td></tr>
        </tfoot>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">From Akeneo data<br>to finished PDF in seconds</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">The Datasheet Automation integrates directly into your Akeneo PIM — no separate login, no manual data export required.</p>
    <div class="steps" style="border: 1px solid var(--ib-sand-60); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div class="step-title">Trigger generation</div>
        <div class="step-desc">Click the "Generate PDF" button in the Akeneo product header — or let the Pro scheduler handle it automatically at a set time.</div>
        <span class="step-tag both">Both editions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div class="step-title">Live data is fetched</div>
        <div class="step-desc">Product data is automatically refreshed from Akeneo immediately before generation — every datasheet reflects the latest selected data fields and information blocks.</div>
        <span class="step-tag both">Both editions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div class="step-title">PDF saved and linked</div>
        <div class="step-desc">The finished datasheet is instantly uploaded back to Akeneo as a linked product asset — ready to share, download, or distribute.</div>
        <span class="step-tag both">Both editions</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pro-callout">
      <strong>Datasheet Automation Pro additionally offers:</strong>
      <p>A pre-scheduled automation (e.g. every night) that regenerates all changed products automatically — plus a PDF button directly in the product grid view so you can trigger updates for multiple products simultaneously, without opening each product individually.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4 LAYOUTS -->
<section class="section-sand">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Included in both editions</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Choose 1 of 4 predefined layouts,<br>fully brand-customizable</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Datasheet Automation includes four predefined layout options. During setup, you select one layout as the basis for your automated datasheets. The selected template is then structured around the product data, information blocks, and fields you want to show, customized with your logo and brand colors, and used for consistent PDF generation. Click any layout to view a full example.</p>

    <div class="layouts-grid-new">

      <div class="layout-card-new" onclick="openModal(0)">
        <div class="layout-preview-new">
          <img src="/images/datasheet/ds-b1f56e9d.jpg" alt="Layout 1 – Vertical" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;">
        </div>
        <div class="layout-meta">
          <div class="layout-name">Layout 1 — Vertical</div>
          <div class="layout-hint">Image + benefits + specs table</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-card-new" onclick="openModal(1)">
        <div class="layout-preview-new">
          <img src="/images/datasheet/ds-4b90c983.jpg" alt="Layout 2 – Horizontal" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;">
        </div>
        <div class="layout-meta">
          <div class="layout-name">Layout 2 — Horizontal</div>
          <div class="layout-hint">3-column spec sheet, landscape</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-card-new" onclick="openModal(2)">
        <div class="layout-preview-new">
          <img src="/images/datasheet/ds-59e02aba.jpg" alt="Layout 3 – Image-focused" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;">
        </div>
        <div class="layout-meta">
          <div class="layout-name">Layout 3 — Image-focused</div>
          <div class="layout-hint">Large image + rating bars + specs</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-card-new" onclick="openModal(3)">
        <div class="layout-preview-new">
          <img src="/images/datasheet/ds-293035b7.jpg" alt="Layout 4 – Table-oriented" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;">
        </div>
        <div class="layout-meta">
          <div class="layout-name">Layout 4 — Table-oriented</div>
          <div class="layout-hint">Product image + multi-row data table</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- end layouts-grid-new -->
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LIGHTBOX MODAL -->
<div id="layout-modal" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeModal()" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.75);z-index:1000;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:1rem;">
  <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:8px;width:min(920px,96vw);max-height:92vh;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">

    <!-- Modal Header -->
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e6dcc8;flex-shrink:0;">
      <div>
        <div id="modal-tag" style="font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d31145;margin-bottom:4px;"></div>
        <div id="modal-title" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;color:#313131;letter-spacing:-0.2px;"></div>
        <div id="modal-hint" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#6b6b6b;margin-top:2px;"></div>
      </div>
      <button onclick="closeModal()" style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:26px;color:#6b6b6b;line-height:1;padding:4px 10px;flex-shrink:0;">&times;</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal Body: image left, info right -->
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;min-height:0;">

      <!-- Full layout image -->
      <div style="overflow-y:auto;background:#f0e6dc;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:1.5rem;">
        <img id="modal-img" src="" alt="" style="width:100%;max-width:540px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);display:block;">
      </div>

      <!-- Info panel -->
      <div style="overflow-y:auto;border-left:1px solid #e6dcc8;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;">
        <div id="modal-info-left"></div>
        <div id="modal-info-right"></div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Modal Footer -->
    <div style="padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e6dcc8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-shrink:0;background:#fff;">
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
        <button onclick="prevModal()" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid #e6dcc8;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff;color:#313131;">← Previous</button>
        <button onclick="nextModal()" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid #e6dcc8;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff;color:#313131;">Next →</button>
      </div>
      <div id="modal-counter" style="font-size:12px;color:#6b6b6b;"></div>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/inbetween-sales/30min" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 20px;background:#d31145;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;">Request demo</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TECHNICAL WORKFLOW -->
<section id="technical-workflow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Technical workflow</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">How the PIM-to-PDF<br>automation works</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Datasheet Automation connects Akeneo PIM with InBetween's cloud-based publishing engine. The workflow is designed to keep product PDFs accurate, consistent, and easy to regenerate.</p>
    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="content-card"><h3>1. Product data is retrieved</h3><p>The solution fetches current product information, images, attributes, and product content from Akeneo before PDF generation starts.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>2. Templates are applied</h3><p>The selected predefined layout structures product information into brand-compliant datasheets using customer-specific logo and colors.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>3. PDFs are rendered in the cloud</h3><p>The datasheet is generated as a PDF through a hosted InBetween publishing workflow without local software installation.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>4. Assets are stored back</h3><p>The finished PDF is saved back into Akeneo as a linked product asset so teams can access, share, download, or distribute it directly from the PIM.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- USE CASES -->
<section id="use-cases" class="section-sand">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Use cases and intent matching</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Typical use cases<br>for automated datasheets</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Datasheet Automation supports teams that need reliable product documentation based on structured PIM data instead of manual desktop publishing.</p>
    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="content-card"><h3>Technical datasheets</h3><p>Create technical data sheets with product attributes, specifications, images, benefits, and structured product information from Akeneo.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>B2B sales documents</h3><p>Generate product sheets and product PDFs for sales teams, partners, distributors, and customer-specific product communication.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>Large catalog maintenance</h3><p>Keep PDF documents aligned with frequently changing product data, variants, assortment updates, and market-specific information.</p></div>
      <div class="content-card"><h3>Brand-compliant publishing</h3><p>Ensure all datasheets follow the same corporate design, layout logic, typography, and visual structure across products and teams.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BENEFITS -->
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Why Datasheet Automation</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Replace static PDFs<br>with a dynamic workflow</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">From faster time-to-market to reduced manual effort — here's what teams gain when they move to automated datasheet generation.</p>
